  "footnotes": [],
  "issues": [
    "No prices appear anywhere in the sheet; every priceUsd is null. The only numbers are volumes (SU 330 ml. / 750 ml.), V60, 3. NESIL and liquor labels (NO:7, NO:10, 12 Y.O.).",
    "Menu title row (TEA LOUNGE MENU) is not part of the JSON shape and was dropped.",
    "Herbal tea list (TAZE DEMLEME BITKI CAYLARI) includes BAMYA CICEGI / OKRA FLOWER here, whereas the Cafe Verde sheet has HIBISKUS / HIBISCUS in that position. This sheet also has a FRESH MEYVE SUYU item that Cafe Verde lacks.",
    "MESRUBATLAR / SOFT DRINKS is followed, without a heading, by TAZE DEMLEME BITKI CAYLARI, 3. NESIL KAHVELER and the Ronnefeldt rows; the hot items are kept in document order inside MESRUBATLAR (they have detail lines so they were read as items, not headings).",
    "RONNEFELDT BITKI CAYLARI / RONNEFELDT HERBAL TEAS is immediately followed by RONNEFELDT POSET CAYLAR with no products between: read as a parent heading with two sub-categories (POSET CAYLAR, TAZE DEMLEME CAYLAR). The heading hierarchy is a guess.",
    "3. NESIL KAHVELER / THIRD GENERATION COFFEES has one line 'CHEMEX , V60 , SYPHON' (not bilingual): put in both detailTr and detailEn; could instead be a heading with three items.",
